    "name": "Wireframe Warfare",
    "steam_appid": 3516120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wireframe Warfare is a Singleplayer Action/Tower Defense hybrid game created by a solo developer over the course of a year. Blast and strategize your way through various levels, combating waves of viruses attacking Cyber Beacons across the pathways of a digital space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle 6 different maps and 6 degrees of difficulty, with 7 distinct weapons, 7 varied towers and 75+ Skills to augment your play style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More maps, weapons, towers and skills to come with future updates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >T.A.N.K (ACTION GAMEPLAY)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Armored Nexus Keeper, or\u00a0T.A.N.K\u00a0for short, is a customizable program with several different offensive weapons and modular attachments. During gameplay, you will be controlling your own version of a T.A.N.K, harnessing its power to defend the Cyber Beacons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516120/extras/86901e2e027b9d55ea7956620ad91b6d.avif?t=1744849792\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >S.T.A.N.D (Tower Defense)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure Tower Allocation and Network Defense protocol is the foundation of your defense against Viruses. Deploy offensive towers to deal damage, defensive towers to debuff and utility towers to boost your resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516120/extras/a3d5abcf68053dffff4773541d70fbe1.avif?t=1744849792\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Skill system to tailor the T.A.N.K program to your play style. Like to take hits and keep going? Boost your defense. Tired of having to refill your health or ammo? Boost those too! <br><br>In addition to skills, the T.A.N.K program can also use Attachments. Cosmetic items that boost stats like speed, defense, ramming damage and more. Swap these around to find the combo of Attachments that works best for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your T.A.N.K</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the T.A.N.K program your own with cosmetic items and color variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516120/extras/e5cd5b69017031bfc9b8fa1d5a6d14c9.avif?t=1744849792\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note from Developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Please be aware that the game currently has some limited settings, such as lacking a Rebind keys option and full controller support. Some users have had luck with Steam Deck usage and I will be expanding upon this in the future.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plans to add some additional weapons, towers, skills and maps. So while the game has reached V1.0, there is still more work to be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thank anyone who gives my game a chance and supports my growth as a game developer. I'm only a solo dev and this is my first commercial release, so I look forward to any constructive feedback players can offer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enjoy Wireframe Warfare!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Kyle &quot;Azirin&quot;<br><br>To leave any additional feedback or report bugs, leave them on our Discord! (Discord Link is in game on the main menu)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wireframe Warfare is a Singleplayer Action/Tower Defense hybrid game created by a solo developer over the course of a year. Blast and strategize your way through various levels, combating waves of viruses attacking Cyber Beacons across the pathways of a digital space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle 6 different maps and 6 degrees of difficulty, with 7 distinct weapons, 7 varied towers and 75+ Skills to augment your play style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More maps, weapons, towers and skills to come with future updates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >T.A.N.K (ACTION GAMEPLAY)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Armored Nexus Keeper, or\u00a0T.A.N.K\u00a0for short, is a customizable program with several different offensive weapons and modular attachments. During gameplay, you will be controlling your own version of a T.A.N.K, harnessing its power to defend the Cyber Beacons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516120/extras/86901e2e027b9d55ea7956620ad91b6d.avif?t=1744849792\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >S.T.A.N.D (Tower Defense)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure Tower Allocation and Network Defense protocol is the foundation of your defense against Viruses. Deploy offensive towers to deal damage, defensive towers to debuff and utility towers to boost your resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516120/extras/a3d5abcf68053dffff4773541d70fbe1.avif?t=1744849792\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Skill system to tailor the T.A.N.K program to your play style. Like to take hits and keep going? Boost your defense. Tired of having to refill your health or ammo? Boost those too! <br><br>In addition to skills, the T.A.N.K program can also use Attachments. Cosmetic items that boost stats like speed, defense, ramming damage and more. Swap these around to find the combo of Attachments that works best for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your T.A.N.K</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the T.A.N.K program your own with cosmetic items and color variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516120/extras/e5cd5b69017031bfc9b8fa1d5a6d14c9.avif?t=1744849792\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note from Developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Please be aware that the game currently has some limited settings, such as lacking a Rebind keys option and full controller support. Some users have had luck with Steam Deck usage and I will be expanding upon this in the future.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plans to add some additional weapons, towers, skills and maps. So while the game has reached V1.0, there is still more work to be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thank anyone who gives my game a chance and supports my growth as a game developer. I'm only a solo dev and this is my first commercial release, so I look forward to any constructive feedback players can offer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enjoy Wireframe Warfare!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Kyle &quot;Azirin&quot;<br><br>To leave any additional feedback or report bugs, leave them on our Discord! (Discord Link is in game on the main menu)</p>",
